obs RECOVERED AND LANDED ON A LATER LAP (20260916.200108). This lap died mid-send and its whole set stood in a round-open stash and nowhere else. Three of its file fields named ledger work that was never written -- a REDS row at 20260916.110815, its fold shelf, and the card account -- so they are dropped here rather than left as claims the tree cannot answer; log_file_claim refused the log for exactly that. The module, witness, control and paper lines below stand, and the recovering lap widened the control past the 11 legs this one wrote.
